{"fps": 30, "total": 100.5, "lines": [{"code": "A01", "who": "A", "t0": 0.3, "t1": 6.32, "speech": [0.38, 6.29], "text": "Ujian dekat, tab-ku udah 20! Latihan soal kedokteran yang lengkap tapi gratis tuh di mana sih?!", "words": [{"w": "Ujian", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.671}, {"w": "dekat,", "s": 0.671, "e": 1.133}, {"w": "tab-ku", "s": 1.133, "e": 1.954}, {"w": "udah", "s": 1.954, "e": 2.199}, {"w": "20!", "s": 2.199, "e": 2.631}, {"w": "Latihan", "s": 2.631, "e": 3.397}, {"w": "soal", "s": 3.397, "e": 3.641}, {"w": "kedokteran", "s": 3.641, "e": 4.168}, {"w": "yang", "s": 4.168, "e": 4.412}, {"w": "lengkap", "s": 4.412, "e": 4.917}, {"w": "tapi", "s": 4.917, "e": 5.162}, {"w": "gratis", "s": 5.162, "e": 5.5}, {"w": "tuh", "s": 5.5, "e": 5.698}, {"w": "di", "s": 5.698, "e": 5.848}, {"w": "mana", "s": 5.848, "e": 6.093}, {"w": "sih?!", "s": 6.093, "e": 6.29}]}, {"code": "B01", "who": "B", "t0": 6.52, "t1": 11.64, "speech": [6.61, 11.62], "text": "Coba MEDCOEL. Gratis\u2026 isinya 38.400 soal.", "words": [{"w": "Coba", "s": 6.61, "e": 6.94}, {"w": "MEDCOEL.", "s": 6.94, "e": 7.892}, {"w": "Gratis\u2026", "s": 7.892, "e": 8.509}, {"w": "isinya", "s": 8.509, "e": 9.307}, {"w": "38.400", "s": 9.307, "e": 11.29}, {"w": "soal.", "s": 11.29, "e": 11.62}]}, {"code": "A02", "who": "A", "t0": 12.09, "t1": 16.51, "speech": [12.26, 16.62], "text": "Serius gratis? Kebetulan aku lagi pusing banget sama Anatomi.", "words": [{"w": "Serius", "s": 12.26, "e": 12.714}, {"w": "gratis?", "s": 12.714, "e": 13.289}, {"w": "Kebetulan", "s": 13.289, "e": 14.272}, {"w": "aku", "s": 14.272, "e": 14.537}, {"w": "lagi", "s": 14.537, "e": 14.866}, {"w": "pusing", "s": 14.866, "e": 15.32}, {"w": "banget", "s": 15.32, "e": 15.774}, {"w": "sama", "s": 15.774, "e": 16.103}, {"w": "Anatomi.", "s": 16.103, "e": 16.62}]}, {"code": "B02", "who": "B", "t0": 16.81, "t1": 22.78, "speech": [17.1, 22.84], "text": "Pilih mata kuliahnya, lalu bab yang lagi kamu pelajari. Bab yang belum ada soalnya ditandai segera hadir.", "words": [{"w": "Pilih", "s": 17.1, "e": 17.393}, {"w": "mata", "s": 17.393, "e": 17.639}, {"w": "kuliahnya,", "s": 17.639, "e": 18.121}, {"w": "lalu", "s": 18.121, "e": 18.577}, {"w": "bab", "s": 18.577, "e": 18.776}, {"w": "yang", "s": 18.776, "e": 19.021}, {"w": "lagi", "s": 19.021, "e": 19.267}, {"w": "kamu", "s": 19.267, "e": 19.513}, {"w": "pelajari.", "s": 19.513, "e": 20.448}, {"w": "Bab", "s": 20.448, "e": 20.646}, {"w": "yang", "s": 20.646, "e": 20.892}, {"w": "belum", "s": 20.892, "e": 21.185}, {"w": "ada", "s": 21.185, "e": 21.384}, {"w": "soalnya", "s": 21.384, "e": 21.772}, {"w": "ditandai", "s": 21.772, "e": 22.207}, {"w": "segera", "s": 22.207, "e": 22.547}, {"w": "hadir.", "s": 22.547, "e": 22.84}]}, {"code": "A03", "who": "A", "t0": 23.13, "t1": 25.13, "speech": [23.31, 25.21], "text": "Oke, aku mulai dari bab yang ini.", "words": [{"w": "Oke,", "s": 23.31, "e": 23.51}, {"w": "aku", "s": 23.51, "e": 24.02}, {"w": "mulai", "s": 24.02, "e": 24.315}, {"w": "dari", "s": 24.315, "e": 24.563}, {"w": "bab", "s": 24.563, "e": 24.763}, {"w": "yang", "s": 24.763, "e": 25.01}, {"w": "ini.", "s": 25.01, "e": 25.21}]}, {"code": "B03", "who": "B", "t0": 25.53, "t1": 29.66, "speech": [25.74, 29.79], "text": "Kerjain satu soal. Pakai Mode Learning, jadi pembahasannya langsung muncul.", "words": [{"w": "Kerjain", "s": 25.74, "e": 26.125}, {"w": "satu", "s": 26.125, "e": 26.369}, {"w": "soal.", "s": 26.369, "e": 26.613}, {"w": "Pakai", "s": 26.613, "e": 27.434}, {"w": "Mode", "s": 27.434, "e": 27.678}, {"w": "Learning,", "s": 27.678, "e": 28.11}, {"w": "jadi", "s": 28.11, "e": 28.354}, {"w": "pembahasannya", "s": 28.354, "e": 29.02}, {"w": "langsung", "s": 29.02, "e": 29.452}, {"w": "muncul.", "s": 29.452, "e": 29.79}]}, {"code": "A04", "who": "A", "t0": 29.96, "t1": 32.35, "speech": [30.18, 32.52], "text": "Hmm\u2026 B? Atau C?", "words": [{"w": "Hmm\u2026", "s": 30.18, "e": 30.6}, {"w": "B?", "s": 30.6, "e": 31.28}, {"w": "Atau", "s": 31.28, "e": 32.3}, {"w":